ames@gmail.com","url":"https://bmistudio.live"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Danish, Dutch, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Swedish, Traditional Chinese, Turkish, Vietnamese, Czech, Thai, Hindi<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://bmistudio.live"}